  "text": "KATALOG ONLINE - PERPUSTAKAAN ITS - LINSPRO PERPUSTAKAAN ITS ONLINE ACCESS PUBLIC CATALOGUE BUKU ARTIKEL MULTIMEDIA LAPORAN STUDI PENELITIAN MEDIA CETAK EBOOK KATEGORI SUBYEK Penelusuran Koleksi Buku Kriteria Pencarian » Semua Kolom Judul Koleksi No Klasifikasi Pengarang Utama Pengarang Lain Subyek Seri Koleksi Penerbit Untuk melakukan proses pencarian silahkan memasukkan kata kunci pada kotak yang telah disediakan\n\t\t\tdan kemudian tekan tombol \"Cari\". Untuk mendapatkan hasil pencarian yang akurat maka gunakan kata kunci yang relevan dengan informasi yang hendak dicari. Hasil penelusuran dengan kriteria : Judul Koleksi -> Calculus ditemukan 220 catatan yang sesuai. 1. 515 Lar b » Larson, Roland E. Brief calculus with applications 2. 515 Bar c » Barnett, Reymond A Calculus for business, economics, life sciences, and social sciences 3. 510 Con e » Connelly, James Francis Elementary technical mathematics with calculus 4. 512.13 Sul p » Sullivan, Michael Precalculus 5. 515 Cro c » Crowdis, David G. Calculus for business, biology, and the social science 6. 510.246 2 Dav t » Davis, Linda Technical mathematics with calculus 7. 515.15 You c » Youse, Bevan K. Calculus with analytical geometry 8. 515.15 Lei c » Leithold, Louis calculus with analytic geometry 9. 515.15 Lei c » Leithold, Louis Calculus with analytical geometry ; part 1 10. 515.15 Lei c » Leithold, Louis calculus with analytic geometry 11. 515.15 Fle c » Fleming, Daniel J. Calculus with analytic geometry 12. 515.028 554 1 Mat h » Mathews, Jerold HP 48G calculus companion 13. 515.028 541 She g » Shenk, Al Graphic calculator calculus workbook : an exploratory approach 14. 512.1 Bar p » Barnett, Raymond A. Precalculus : a graphing approach 15. 515 Met c » Mett, Coreen L. Calculus with applications 16. 515 Sma c » Small, Donald B. Calculus : an integrated approach 17. 515 028 5 Sma e » Small, Donald B. Explorations in calculus with a computer algebra system 18. 515.028 5 Smi d » Smith, Robert T. Discovering calculus with the HP-28 and the HP-48 19. 515.3 Ayr s » Ayres, Frank, Jr. Schaum`s outline of theory and problems of differential and integral calculus in SI metric units 20. 515.3 Ayr s » Ayres, Frank, Jr. Schaum`s outline of theory and problems of differential and integral calculus in SI metric units * Klik untuk melihat detil informasi koleksi Ilmu Komputer, Informasi & Karya Umum Filosofi & Psikologi Agama & Kepercayaan Ilmu Sosial Bahasa Ilmu Pengetahuan Teknologi Seni & Re-Kreasi Literatur Sejarah & Geografi Front Office PERPUSTAKAAN ITS Kampus ITS Sukolilo - Surabaya 60111 Telp. 031-5921733 , 5923623 Sistem Informasi Perpustakaan ITS (SPITS) - Engine supported by Linspro",
